{"version":1,"content":"<p>兩名女生近日被指在湖南長沙烈士公園內穿和服、攜武士刀，Cosplay日本人氣動漫《鬼滅之刃》角色拍照，遭路過男子訓斥，影片在社交平台引發熱議，大批網民批評其行為「對烈士不敬」。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T09:02:48.590029+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":88,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T08:13:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T13:58:22.791933+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T08:58:41.132581+00:00","content_hash":"43b2ebc62b3bb4ae93ee1e0dcff9c82d462cbbaf7f2033d6b436f0fb5d14928e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}